      349.15,
      451.27,
      377.42
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause replaces the long title to the Fauna and Flora Protection Ordinance(Chapter 469) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of theamendment is to expand the scope of the principal enactment.",
    "fonts": [
