    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      387.91,
      451.21,
      416.18
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3: This clause amends section 71 of the principal enactment and the legal effect asamended is to empower the Minister to make regulations in order to give effect to the Conventionon International Trade in Endangered Species of Wild Fauna and Flora (CITES).",
