    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      268.61,
      401.9,
      292.91
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      304.61,
      401.87,
      328.91
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Fauna and FloraProtection (Amendment) Act, No. of 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      340.61,
      401.88,
      390.95
    ],
    "text": "2. The long title to the Fauna and Flora ProtectionOrdinance (Chapter 469) (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby repealed and the followinglong title substituted therefor:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.89,
      402.65,
      401.91,
      530.87
    ],
    "text": "\u201cAn Ordinance to provide for the protection andconservation of the Fauna and Flora of Sri Lankaand their habitats; for the prevention of commercialand other misuse of such Fauna and Flora and theirhabitats; for the conservation of biodiversity ofSri Lanka; to take such measures to give effect tothe convention on International Trade inEndangered species of Wild Fauna and Flora(CITES); and to provide for matters connectedtherewith or incidental thereto.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      542.57,
      401.88,
      592.91
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 71 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (2) thereof, by the insertionimmediately after paragraph (f) of that subsection, of thefollowing new paragraphs:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.13,
      604.61,
      401.9,
      668.03
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(fa) all matters necessary for the enforcement of theprovisions of the Convention on International Tradein Endangered Species of Wild Fauna and Flora(CITES), subject to the prior written approved ofthe Cabinet of Ministers;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      543.31,
      453.58,
      590.78
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section 71of theprincipalenactment",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      166.97,
      363.09,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "Fauna and Flora Protection (Amendment)2",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Italic",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
